/**
 * Small (128x128), hand-drawn illustrated portraits -- the default art used by
 * `Avatar`'s `placeholder` prop when no real `src` is supplied yet. Each is ~4-6KB, embedded as a
 * data URI so the feature works with zero setup (no static-asset serving required) and adds only
 * ~520KB total to a bundle that actually uses it. Source originals (1024x1024) live in
 * `placeholders/avatar-N.{jpeg,webp}` at the repo root, numbered in the same order as this array.
 */

